msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DA2CE17_6D52_4AD7_8BE6_7554BB814987"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it had for as long as I could remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫И так было столько, сколько я себя помню."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFBBA795_374C_4B95_A3D4_D000C829AE2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83fa4536caf597a5da3118f54605b5153386947efb6b4db82b37795ebb405f40
